NOTE ON DATASETS

This licence covers the source code only. The datasets this project trains on
are third-party and carry their own terms:

  NASA PCoE Li-ion Battery Dataset      NASA Open Data, public domain
  NEU Surface Defect Database           Northeastern University, research use
  Casting product image data            Kaggle, CC BY-NC-SA 4.0 (NON-COMMERCIAL)
  CEA CO2 Baseline Database             Central Electricity Authority, Govt. of India
  Environment Canada fuel consumption   Open Government Licence - Canada

The casting dataset is non-commercial. None of these are redistributed here;
see SETUP.md for how to obtain each one.
